1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:08,505
Night, what the hell should I do about Earth?
Wait—so you came here just to talk about Earth?

2
00:00:09,867 --> 00:00:12,655
Well, I mean… you’re kinda
experienced with boys.

3
00:00:12,655 --> 00:00:16,880
What the fuck, man? So you’re trying to
win Earth over or what?

4
00:00:17,625 --> 00:00:20,400
No—no! It’s not what you think, you asshole.

5
00:00:21,538 --> 00:00:26,837
Then what do you want? If you’re not into the kid,
why are you overthinking it?

6
00:00:28,760 --> 00:00:34,160
It’s just… I don’t know how to explain it.
The vibe in the room felt fucking weird.

7
00:00:34,160 --> 00:00:35,731
When I’m with him, it’s suffocating.

8
00:00:35,731 --> 00:00:38,050
I talk to him and he doesn’t even look at me
—think about that.

9
00:00:38,883 --> 00:00:44,694
Dude, you brought this
shit on yourself. Seriously.

10
00:00:45,896 --> 00:00:52,350
So did you do anything to the kid?
Like… did you sleep with him?

11
00:00:53,632 --> 00:00:55,996
I was drunk last Night, so I…

12
00:00:58,800 --> 00:01:02,750
You idiot. And how many times
have you “done it” already?

13
00:01:02,750 --> 00:01:05,840
Fuck—shut the hell up, can you not?

14
00:01:06,552 --> 00:01:08,749
It’s not like you’re terrible at it or anything.

15
00:01:09,117 --> 00:01:11,607
If you were that bad,
I wouldn’t be friends with you.

16
00:01:12,584 --> 00:01:16,644
But if you want my advice about Earth—

17
00:01:17,445 --> 00:01:24,423
I think you should try opening up a bit.
Like actually talk to him.

18
00:01:24,423 --> 00:01:31,040
Tell him how you feel, what you regret.
At least he’ll understand you better.

19
00:01:33,139 --> 00:01:34,877
So… I have to apologize to him?

20
00:01:36,223 --> 00:01:41,400
You dumbass, are you messing with me?
That’s literally what I just said.

21
00:01:42,602 --> 00:01:48,917
Fine.
Yeah, fuck it—I'll give it a try.
